      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "The greatest fighters of the realm have trained here.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Sallat\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0001",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "How may I help you stranger?",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Warwick\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My wares can help you in your quest.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Othon\u0027s Tower",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0003",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "I can help you fight the demon invasion!",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Furren\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224SI0004",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "I sell everything... for a price.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutrals",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Winfrid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224PL0009",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In his youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. He then became sovereign of his realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Baldaric",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224PL000a",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Highest lord of the dwarf lords, he is known for his intensity in battle and his courage in the face of overwhelming odds. He once fought seven days and nights against the mighty red dragon ARFURUZON to finally defeat him.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emery",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lantfrid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0023",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Inferno",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Look, our very presence seems to be cleansing the ground of the evil which permeates it! Our influence is overcoming this terrible Evil.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Clan is victorious over the evil disease that spread in this land...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture Avgrundskval",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022It\u0027s amazing! Our presence is transforming the ground we walk on and closing up the infernal lava holes... The faith of our troops in this cause is renewed!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Raining Demons",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cemetary",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022The Demons have even looted our holy sanctuary for the dead! We must have revenge!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0028",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Necromancer",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Necromancer: \u0022Ha ha ha! Bow before your new master, insignificant mortals! Our Dragon Lord will crush all of you with but one breath! \u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Peasant Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We are loyal to the Empire no more. We will take of ourselves, so stay away from our lands, soldiers!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN002b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "peasant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Demonologist Spell",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Unfortunately for you mortals, this is our realm now! How dare you soil this land with your presence!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN002c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peasant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Unholy Portal",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Demons \n\u0022Death comes to all that seek it! And this is what you have found!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Visit Camp",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Lorn: \u0022Please wait! Let us join your cause, we do not wish to serve the Dragon Overlord any longer!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Visit Dwarf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dwarf: \u0022Finally, you have come to continue the crusade against the evil Dragon Lord! I am too tired to carry on... Take this, it will help you greatly...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Peasant Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Stupid Dwarves, stay out of our village! Humans only are allowed here!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Disable MC Peasant Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Clans, we will defend ourselves!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0032",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Win",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0010",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We have vanquished the evil in this land, in the name of the Highfather!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We have lived peacefully, side by side, with the Mountain Clans in these lands for as long as we can remember. Until one day, the sky grew dark in the south, and a suffocating heat rose from the ground.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0011",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We did nothing, afraid, until it was too late. Our citizens are fleeing the cities, hysterical, and the entire landscape has been thrown into chaos. We must now find the source of the Evil, and destroy it!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0035",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We have lived peacefully, side by side, with the Empire in these lands for as long as we can remember. Until one day, the sky grew dark in the south, and a suffocating heat rose from the ground.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0012",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We did nothing, afraid, until it was too late. Our citizens are fleeing the capital, hysterical, and the entire landscape has been thrown into chaos. We must now find the source of the Evil, and destroy it!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Enable Raining Demons",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0013",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Demons are appearing from the ground! They must be stopped!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC North Keep West",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Stay away from our city, Clansmen! We don\u0027t like your kind, Humans only!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC North Keep East",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0015",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Stay away from our city, Clansmen! We don\u0027t like your kind, Humans only!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224UN0039",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peasant",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire North Keep East",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0016",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Empire soldiers, you couldn\u0027t defend us from the Demons, so we defend ourselves! Now stay away before we have to!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire North Keep West",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0017",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Empire soldiers, you couldn\u0027t defend us from the Demons, so we defend ourselves! Now stay away before we have to!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "MC Near Unholy Portal",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0018",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Milord! We sense some kind of powerful evil trap! A searing heat is arising from the ground...We should prepare ourselves with our best spells!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Near Unholy Portal",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV0019",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Milord! We sense some kind of powerful evil trap! We must be prepared, we feel a searing heat arising... May the Highfather be with us...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Empire Visit Dwarf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Are you here to slay the evil dragon? Please, I am fatally hurt and I cannot go on... Take this, and slay the dragon...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Near Squire",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We don\u0027t need your help to slay these beasts! Stay back, we are armed to the teeth!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S224EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Near Zombie",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S224SC0000",
